                    insight_exemplary:      `Value captured and defensible: you moved IMP from a 19% build-to-print position toward the partner band, anchored to a scarce qualification capability, filled the constraint with secured volume, and stayed inside the R$40M envelope. That is value captured because it was earned.`,
